<title>LATVIA: LATVIA-UNIBANKA, JEKBAPILS GAIN AGAIN ON BOURSE.</title>
<headline>LATVIA-UNIBANKA, JEKBAPILS GAIN AGAIN ON BOURSE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
